<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="9b365bbd">&lt;p&gt;
    Based on the understanding of the system which requires support and the non-functional requirements, lay out the plan
    for the support by first explaining the objectives, assumptions and strategy. Confirm the system configurations
    including software and hardware for the production environment. Document the details related to the service desk or
    support function necessary for post go live support. Review the plan and obtain approval.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
